lackboard!\n```\n\n---\n\n⚡ **Would you like to extend this environment application with a REST/WebSocket API wrapper, or shall we connect it to a multi-agent MTPO concurrency controller next?**. \n</USER_REQUEST>\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\nThe current local time is: 2026-09-28T14:23:29-04:00.\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>","truncated_fields":["content"]}
