ted heuristics with a reinforcement‑learning (RL) policy that decides **whether** and **how** to write a new memory entry.  The policy is trained on a proxy reward that balances:\\n- **Recall accuracy** (reward for useful retrievals)\\n- **Trust metrics** (penalise updates that later cause contradictions)\\n- **Abstention** (reward for refusing to write when confidence is low)\\n\\n### Prototype Sketch\\n- **Module:** `src/policy/rl_write.py`\\n- **State representation:** (embedding of current query, provenance tag, confidence score, recent write‑frequency).\\n- **Action space:** `{ADD, UPDATE, DELETE, ABSTAIN}`.\\n- **Reward signal:** derived from downstream task performance (e.g., classification on a held‑out validation set) plus a *trust* term based on `record_event` audit logs.\\n- **Training data:** generate synthetic enterprise logs using the existing `src/memory.py` – emulate noisy updates, conflicting entries, and periodic audits.\\n- **Integration point:** Hook into `src/retention.py` when `record_event` is called; the policy decides whether to materialise the write.\\n\\n### Experiment Suggestions\\n| Metric | How to Measure |\\n|--------|----------------|\\n| **Precision@k** of retrieved facts after 30 days | Use a static benchmark of enterprise FAQs.\\n| **Abstention rate** | Ratio of `ABSTAIN` decisions.\\n| **Trust uplift** | Compare consistency of answers before/after policy adoption (e.g., number of contradictory answers).\\n\\n### Risks & Mitigations\\n- **Reward sparsity:** Use shaping – give small incremental rewards on intermediate consistency checks.\\\n<truncated 6413 bytes>","Description":"\"Create a brainstorming markdown artifact that expands on LinkTec Labs' five hypotheses with concrete research ideas, prototype sketches, validation plans, and an integration roadmap for the SSOT repository.\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"/Volumes/Untitled/SSOT_Agentic_Brain_v1.1.0_ENGINEERING_RELEASE/docs/ideas/linktec_hypotheses.md\"","toolAction":"\"Creating brainstorming artifact\"","toolSummary":"\"Generating ideas document\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
